cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Redalyc Exporter (Exportador Redalyc)"
abstract: >-
  Browser bookmarklet, extension and userscript that export the search results
  of Redalyc (redalyc.org) to RIS, BibTeX or CSV, including title, authors,
  journal, volume, issue, pages, ISSN, DOI, language, abstract and keywords,
  together with a plain-text search log that supports reporting according to
  PRISMA-S.
authors:
